{{Term/Store|Snowcoat Fox|Snowcoat Foxes|Series, BotW, TotK|plural}} are recurring [[Creature]]s in {{TLoZ Series}}.<ref>{{Cite|'''Snowcoat Fox'''|Hyrule Compendium|BotW}}</ref><ref>{{Cite|'''Snowcoat Fox'''|Hyrule Compendium|TotK}}</ref>

==Characteristics==
==={{BotW|-}}===
{{Compendium/Extract|Snowcoat Fox}}
Snowcoat Foxes are a breed of [[Grassland Fox]]es that have adapted for life in [[Freezing Climate]]s.<ref name="Compendium">{{Cite|This particular breed of grassland fox makes its home in cold climates such as the Tabantha region. Its fur turned white as a means of adapting to snowy weather, serving as a natural camouflage. Because of this, spotting one in the snow takes a keen eye.|Hyrule Compendium|BotW}}</ref> They possess a much paler coloration in response to their environment, sporting pale blue fur in place of their lowland relatives' orange coats in order to better blend in with their snowy surroundings.<ref name="Compendium"/> While they are most common in [[Hebra]], they can be found in other cold spots in [[Hyrule|Hyrule Kingdom]], such as [[Mount Lanayru]] and the [[Gerudo Highlands]].

When Snowcoat Foxes are startled by [[Link]] or an [[Enemy]], they will run away. If they are killed, Snowcoat Foxes will drop either [[Raw Prime Meat]] or [[Raw Gourmet Meat]].

